  "content": "<h1>重新構想的介面 - 暗色版</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freimaginedguidark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth上的Unique Dark\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/reimaginedguidark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"CurseForge上的Unique Dark\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon上的amongstreality\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee上的amongstreality\"></a></p><p>替換遊戲中所有容器介面，更改快捷欄、生命值與護甲圖示。</p><blockquote>\n<p>如果您在尋找亮色版本，請點擊這裡 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freimaginedguilight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">重新構想的介面 - 亮色版</a></p>\n</blockquote><h2>您可以在這裡支持我和我的專案</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p><h2>模組支援</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backslot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backslot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcapes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Capes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcurios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventorio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventorio</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmidnightcontrols\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightControls</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fno-chat-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Chat Reports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Notebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shulker Box Tooltip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/metal-barrels/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Metal Barrels</a></li>\n</ul><h2>使用條款</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">版權所有 © 重新構想的介面 - 暗色版</p>\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">作者 AmongstReality</p>\n<p style=\"color:#e1e3e4;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;fon